    description: "WHAT (as reported)\nThe pip package does not include the JSON schema (docs/schema.json lives only in the repository), so output cannot be validated from an install; and the repository's schema on the default branch is ahead of the released tool (0.21.1 against 10.0.0's 0.21.0), so validating a release's output against the repository copy reports a version mismatch.\n\nNOT CHECKED\nWhether any package ships a schema file under another name. Related, distinct: WI-zogop (the Symbol.kind enum in the schema).\n\nREPORTED, NOT RE-RUN. Source: an outside reviewer who tried hypergumbo 10.0.0 from PyPI on 2026-11-24 (transcript pasted by the owner in session). Nothing in this item was run on dev by the filing agent unless a line says so; the reviewer's fixtures are not on this machine. FIRST STEP: reproduce on current dev with a fixture, and check the unreleased changelog, before building anything. Filed at the owner's request (\"file them all now\")."  # 6ab9
